"""
GRAP - Galera Real-time Analysis Parser (Enhanced Production Implementation)

A comprehensive Galera cluster log parser with advanced entity extraction and filtering.
Supports IST (Incremental State Transfer) tracking, entity filtering, YAML output, and more.

FEATURES:
- Complete entity extraction (SST, IST, Views, Nodes, Errors, Transactions)
- Entity filtering by type (--entities=SST,NODE,VIEW)
- Multiple output formats (text, json, yaml)
- Confidence threshold filtering
- Intelligent caching system
- Multi-node cluster analysis
- IST workflow tracking with progress monitoring
"""

